## 5. Extract-algorithms checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + complexity validation
- [ ] Implementation blocks verbatim from cited `file:line` (no pseudo-code)
- [ ] Complexity claims cite empirical benchmark OR analytical proof
- [ ] "Tests / properties" backed by real test (not invented)
- [ ] Crypto section (3) includes independent audit reference
- [ ] >=50% of references are `[verified]`

### Coverage

- [ ] At least 5 algorithms documented (8 ideal)
- [ ] Each algorithm has Big-O + practical constant
- [ ] Each algorithm has real code snippet with file:line
- [ ] Properties / tests captured (idempotence, determinism, etc.)
- [ ] Crypto algorithms (if any) isolated in section 3 with warnings
- [ ] Portability target explicit for each algorithm
- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/extract/algorithms.md`
- [ ] Cross-link from `wiki/index.md`